// Own stress test (INVALID Janus on purpose): `x += x` has the assigned
// variable on the right-hand side, which Janus forbids because it is not
// invertible (`x -= x` zeroes x instead of halving it).  pyjanus2pisa used to
// accept it ("self-referencing assignment optimization"); since 2026-09-26 it
// is rejected at compile time (difftest: COMPILE-ERROR, DIFFTEST.md D9).
int x = 21
procedure main
  x += x
